# NOTE: agent/planning docs (CLAUDE.md, AGENTS.md, PLANS.md, SECURITY.md,
# docs/agent/) are tracked in the PRIVATE repo so they sync across machines.
# scripts/release.sh strips them from the public mirror (PRIVATE_PATHS) and
# aborts if any is still tracked — so they never leak. Do NOT re-ignore them.
supabase/.temp/
# .claude/ project config (launch.json, commands, settings) is tracked in the
# PRIVATE repo so it syncs across machines; release.sh strips it from the public
# mirror (PRIVATE_PATHS) and aborts if it's still tracked. Keep machine-local out.
.claude/settings.local.json
*.local

